  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Qualify Substack Newsletters for B2B Sponsorships & Extract Top Posts Engagement\n\n**Actor:** [Substack Newsletter Leads, Authors & Posts Scraper: Engagement & Sponsorship Data](https://apify.com/storeintel/substack-newsletter-leads-posts-scraper)\n\n### What this workflow does\nExtract Substack publication sponsor leads (author bio, Twitter/X handle, paid subscription status, average reactions & comments) and full post archives.\n\n### Who is this for?\n- **B2B Sales & Outbound Agencies** building targeted prospect lists.\n- **RevOps & Growth Teams** enriching CRM records automatically.\n- **Market Researchers** tracking pricing, reviews, and hiring velocity.\n\n### Pre-Built Specialized Apify Tasks\n- [Substack Newsletter B2B Sponsorship Leads Scraper](https://apify.com/storeintel/substack-newsletter-b2b-sponsorship-leads-scraper)\n- [Substack Posts, Reactions & Engagement Scraper](https://apify.com/storeintel/substack-top-posts-engagement-metrics-scraper)\n- [Substack Paid Newsletter Authors & Socials Scraper](https://apify.com/storeintel/substack-paid-newsletter-authors-twitter-scraper)",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview-8",
      "name": "Workflow Overview & Use Case",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Configuration & Apify Credentials\n\n1. Create a free account or sign in at [Apify Store — StoreIntel Labs](https://apify.com/storeintel/substack-newsletter-leads-posts-scraper).\n2. Copy your personal API Token from **Apify Console → Settings → Integrations**.\n3. In the **2. Run StoreIntel Scraper** node, configure the **Header Auth** credential (`Name: Authorization`, `Value: Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`).\n4. Customize the target URLs, slugs, or search keywords in **1. Configure Target Parameters**.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup-8",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Lead Qualification & Export\n\n- **Filter Qualified B2B Leads:** Automatically removes empty or incomplete records before writing to your CRM.\n- **Map CRM & Outreach Fields:** Normalizes fields into a clean table schema.\n- **Append to Google Sheets:** Connect your Google Sheets OAuth2 credential and select your destination spreadsheet (or swap this node for HubSpot, Pipedrive, Instantly, or Slack).",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-downstream-8",
      "name": "Qualification & Export Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        160
      ]
